It's nearly October, and so it's time again to commit to drawing for the month. This trend started many years ago with "InkTober" ... which has led to interesting commercialization efforts centered around bundles of art supplies and t-shirts you can buy and then not complete the challenge of drawing for 31 days with.

Anyway, I figured it was time to introduce my own. So, here's the prompt list for CorpTober 2026. Feel free to skip the weekend days. And, yeah, you'll notice "Manager PTO" is on there a lot. It's inspired by the scary experience of being in a corporate environment. Here's the "official flyer" (if you'd like a printed copy, send a self-addressed stamped envelope, or ask me for the full size). All Rights Reserved. Accept no substitutes, etc, etc, etc.

